    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "description": "Number of disks per host whose latest native smartctl exit mask is nonzero. The table above shows devices and original numeric flags. An unsupported optional command may set flags while health and attributes remain valid. This count is separate from failed SMART health; absent metrics do not become zero.",
